sequenceDiagram
    actor Client as STOMP client
    participant Transport as WebSocket / STOMP
    participant Telemetry as Telemetry
    participant Controller as TelemetryController
    participant Service as UavService
    participant UavRepository as UavRepository
    participant TelemetryRepository as TelemetryRepository
    participant Uav as Uav

    Client->>Transport: SEND /app/telemetry + telemetry payload
    Transport->>Telemetry: deserialize and validate snapshot
    alt Invalid telemetry
        Telemetry-->>Transport: IllegalArgumentException
    else Valid telemetry
        Telemetry-->>Transport: validated snapshot
        Transport->>Controller: receiveTelemetry(telemetry, principal)
        Controller->>Controller: parse principal name as UUID
        Controller->>Service: updateTelemetry(uavId, telemetry)
        Service->>Service: require matching authenticated and payload IDs
        Service->>UavRepository: findById(uavId)
        alt UAV is registered and sample is newer
            UavRepository-->>Service: Uav
            Service->>TelemetryRepository: save(telemetry)
            TelemetryRepository-->>Service: stored snapshot
            Service->>Uav: update position and status
            Service->>UavRepository: save(uav)
            UavRepository-->>Service: updated UAV
            Service-->>Controller: updated UAV
        else Identity mismatch, unknown UAV, or stale sample
            Service-->>Controller: IllegalArgumentException
        end
    end
    Note over Client,Uav: History is process-local. No acknowledgement or state update is published.
